"""Makes the free ebook and the newsletter ONE list: the ebook page signs people up to the newsletter (with the same confirm-by-email step), the confirm page gives the download, the old separate ebook sign-up is removed, and the Privacy policy is simplified to match.

Run it from the project folder, AFTER unzipping starscapes-ebook-one-list-21oct.zip into it:   python3 tools/add-ebook-one-list.py

What it does: it makes exact edits to ten files that already exist, removes the old ebook sign-up code (lib/ebookSignup.js, keeping a copy), and adds new files from the zip (two tests and these notes; the unzip also replaces five tests).
  src/data/legalPages.js, lib/newsletter.js, src/newsletter/newsletterRules.js, src/ebook/FreeEbookPage.jsx, src/newsletter/NewsletterLinkPage.jsx, src/newsletter/newsletterApi.js, src/ebook/ebookConfig.js, api/ebook-signup.js, sql/ebook-signups.sql, tools/health-check.mjs

How it keeps you safe:
  - It checks ALL 10 files first. If any is not exactly the way it expects, it changes NOTHING and says which.
  - Before changing a file it keeps a copy, ending .before-ebook-one-list.
  - It is safe to run twice: a file already done is left alone.
  - The new files (test/ebook-one-list.test.js, test/ebook-one-list-pages.test.jsx, INSTALL-EBOOK-ONE-LIST.txt) come in the zip itself.
"""
